  (text "S-17: RN60 (47R x4) is the only damping on IO0/IO1/IO3, at U8 pins 58-60; R64 33R at U8 pin 1.\nNo RAM-side resistor (APS6404L drives at 50R). Qualify read and write timing at the loaded pins."
    (at 224.536 72.39 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "d16a92d9-96b6-4d16-a7a7-3558a88324e8")
  )
  (text "NE-20: R907 isolates card write-current steps from +3V3_D.\n+3V3_SD feeds J3.4, C62, C63 and U901 VCC/RDATA_VCC (EMIF06 90k pull-ups, ESD)."
    (at 191.262 24.892 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "e38aa8f4-0101-4a31-bc49-e2105e03fd7f")
  )
  (text "S-19(a): U901 EMIF06-MSD02N16 = 45R + pi filter (<= 20 pF) per line, 90k pull-ups, 8 kV contact ESD.\nDAT3 pull-up: RDATA_VCC tied to VCC (ST Fig. 2/9). RDAT3_GND (470k pull-down) unused.\nFirmware: SDMMC1 GPIO speed medium (no MCU-side source resistor)."
    (at 91.694 158.496 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "58d53aad-4417-4972-985b-ca5643bcc7a3")
  )
  (text "MCU via RN60 / R64 to U9"
    (at 99.695 187.96 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "de3f9cc8-d57f-4996-8080-82b0e7908960")
  )
  (text "MCU via U901 to J3"
    (at 99.695 190.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "5aa24b6d-6ac9-4449-a32d-4a84788d03a8")
  )
  (text "MCU via U901 to J3"
    (at 99.695 193.04 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "79549e90-5013-4715-9bde-8386fc5676c5")
  )
  (text "J3 / U901 WP-CD to MCU"
    (at 99.695 195.58 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "9c0cd823-bdfa-4507-b25d-74efd0b1e957")
  )
  (text "U901 to J3 (filtered, ESD)"
    (at 99.695 198.12 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
    (uuid "e0a8632a-ec4f-4caa-addc-08e21642b289")
  )
